I've noticed an annoying bug in omega.  When doing targeting, if your
motion causes the screen to scroll, the creatures, etc. on the screen
are not redrawn until you complete the command (with a '.').  For example,
try typing 'x', then move until the screen scrolls.  The objects of interest
disappear until you complete the command, which generally forces you to
have to issue it again.


